attribution: Traditional English ballad (Child 2, descended from "The Elfin Knight", printed from the 17th century); the melody is the traditional Yorkshire tune in the Dorian mode; words and tune are public domain worldwide.
tags: english, ballad, modal, dorian, slow

# Dorian mode: written as D minor, so the raised 6th (B natural on "rose-ma-RY") is expected.

