# Verse 1
Are you go-ing to Scar-bo-rough Fair?
D4(2) D4 A4/ A4. A4 E4. F4/ E4 D4(3)
Pars-ley, sage, rose-ma-ry and thyme,
r A4 C5 D5(2) C5 A4 B4 G4 A4(2)
